### Personal ledger without Bearer → 401
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/studio-ledger/solo-claims?year=2026&month=10

### Personal ledger with a non-owner Bearer → 2xx
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/studio-ledger/solo-claims?year=2026&month=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Band claims with a non-owner Bearer → 2xx
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/studio-ledger/band-claims?year=2026&month=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Venue expenses with a non-owner Bearer → 2xx
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/studio-ledger/venue-expenses?year=2026&month=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Tutor shares with a non-owner Bearer → 2xx
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/studio-ledger/instructor-shares?year=2026&month=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Own partner allocation with a non-owner Bearer → 2xx
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/studio-ledger/my-allocation?year=2026&month=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Partner books with a non-owner Bearer → 403
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/studio-ledger/partners
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Partner books with the owner Bearer → 2xx
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/studio-ledger/partners
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Personal ledger with the owner Bearer → 403
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/studio-ledger/solo-claims?year=2026&month=10
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
